    "Performs a best-effort proxy or VPN classification only for a newly seen public address." : {"localizations":{"zh-Hans":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"仅对新出现的公网地址进行尽力而为的代理或 VPN 判断。"}}}},
