    "Prism checks IPv4 and IPv6 independently. Location lookup prefers IPv4 and uses IPv6 when IPv4 is unavailable." : {"localizations":{"zh-Hans":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Prism 会分别检测 IPv4 和 IPv6。位置查询优先使用 IPv4；IPv4 不可用时使用 IPv6。"}}}},
    "Prism checks every 5 seconds while stable, briefly switches to 250 ms confirmation after a possible change, and reduces activity in Low Power Mode." : {"localizations":{"zh-Hans":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"网络稳定时每 5 秒检查一次；发现可能变化后短暂切换至 250 毫秒确认，低电量模式下会自动降低频率。"}}}},
    "Prism checks the public exit four times per second. Location services are contacted only after the address changes." : {"localizations":{"zh-Hans":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Prism 持续监测公网出口；只有地址变化后才会请求位置服务。"}}}},
    "Prism could not determine the current network exit." : {"localizations":{"zh-Hans":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Prism 无法确定当前网络出口。"}}}},
